Subject: [PATCH 05/10] mpeg2_cuda: B pictures (frame/field, fwd/bwd/bi),
 reordering, open GOPs, sequence_end_code; RC for three picture types

---
 libavcodec/mpeg2_cuda.c  | 557 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-----------
 libavcodec/mpeg2_cuda.cu | 425 ++++++++++++++++++++---------
 libavcodec/mpeg2_cuda.h  |  19 +-
 3 files changed, 720 insertions(+), 281 deletions(-)

diff --git a/libavcodec/mpeg2_cuda.c b/libavcodec/mpeg2_cuda.c
index 7162bb1..b51c197 100644
--- a/libavcodec/mpeg2_cuda.c
+++ b/libavcodec/mpeg2_cuda.c
@@ -21,14 +21,18 @@
 /*
  * Everything from motion estimation to slice packing runs on the GPU; the
  * host only writes sequence/GOP/picture headers and runs rate control.
- * Pictures are coded as interlaced frame pictures (I and P), one slice per
- * macroblock row.
+ * Pictures are coded as interlaced frame pictures (I, P and B), one slice
+ * per macroblock row. With B pictures the encoder buffers max_b_frames
+ * source pictures on the GPU, codes the next anchor first and then the B
+ * pictures in between (open GOPs).
  */
 
